Common network connection types include:

Ethernet: Wired connections using cables. [Wire:(Category 5,5e,6 cable) With Socket(RJ45)]

Wi-Fi: Wireless connections using radio waves.
Cellular: Mobile data connections (3G, 4G, 5G).
DSL: Digital Subscriber Line, using phone lines.
Fiber Optic: High-speed connections using light signals.
Satellite: Internet access via satellite dish.
